{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17905","headline":"奉酬中书相公至日圆丘摄事合於中书後阁宿斋移止於集贤院叙怀见寄之作 · 裴度","name":"奉酬中书相公至日圆丘摄事合於中书後阁宿斋移止於集贤院叙怀见寄之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翼亮登三命，谟猷本一心。\n致斋移秘府，祗事见冲襟。\n皓月当延阁，祥风自禁林。\n相庭方积玉，王度已如金。\n运偶唐虞盛，情同丙魏深。\n幽兰与白雪，何处寄庸音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴度","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}